{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a factory that gets increasingly automated. The output of the factory is used to create and upgrade a planet-splitting drill that consumes massive amounts of energy. Craft Combat Units and watch them fight for control over enemy controlled sites like Power Plants, design a system that wins the war against a Runaway Artificial Superintelligence, all via logistics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/e9bb1763ca7d585d135f58cde45cb0cc.avif?t=1774551746\" width=780 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start small with manual mining and grow your factory to automate everything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/79df8324cccc2f4ce430a0dfdbd2dd01.poster.avif?t=1774551746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/79df8324cccc2f4ce430a0dfdbd2dd01.webm?t=1774551746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/79df8324cccc2f4ce430a0dfdbd2dd01.mp4?t=1774551746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/5ce67415c91e49f1911aa925deb3691f.avif?t=1774551746\" width=780 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The procedurally generated sandbox worlds allow you to create your own factory layout in any way imaginable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/644134c8c7c4ce8cb40f8bf332b6d761.poster.avif?t=1774551746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/644134c8c7c4ce8cb40f8bf332b6d761.webm?t=1774551746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/644134c8c7c4ce8cb40f8bf332b6d761.mp4?t=1774551746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/787bc1f17297074f40cfb72f9b1279ea.avif?t=1774551746\" width=780 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Move units to enemy sites via conveyors and capture them with auto-battle mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/8d49f182558b2adca0e7c035efeb972d.poster.avif?t=1774551746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/8d49f182558b2adca0e7c035efeb972d.webm?t=1774551746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/8d49f182558b2adca0e7c035efeb972d.mp4?t=1774551746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/757b1180e4f446d7fe6382d560eb59bb.avif?t=1774551746\" width=780 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use the Core Splitter Drill to drill down into the world, upgrade it to progress faster and get more rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/ae6cd69776ff31f7d4cb439e2723eefc.poster.avif?t=1774551746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/ae6cd69776ff31f7d4cb439e2723eefc.webm?t=1774551746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/ae6cd69776ff31f7d4cb439e2723eefc.mp4?t=1774551746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/de033b08a3bacb627ec4a982b09e1d16.avif?t=1774551746\" width=723 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core splitter is made by a  solo indie developer including music, art, assets, programming and story. The game takes  inspiration from Factorio and Satisfactory which are some of my favorite all time games. While also putting a different spin on some mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075990?t=1774551746","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/766bbcc9690dda6f6f419514b399be5f499efeb8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774551746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/adcc74d9e865eb88dd7df75ed08084e8418c4127/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774551746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/adcc74d9e865eb88dd7df75ed08084e8418c4127/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774551746","cat