steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/8d49f182558b2adca0e7c035efeb972d.mp4?t=1774551746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/757b1180e4f446d7fe6382d560eb59bb.avif?t=1774551746\" width=780 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use the Core Splitter Drill to drill down into the world, upgrade it to progress faster and get more rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/ae6cd69776ff31f7d4cb439e2723eefc.poster.avif?t=1774551746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/ae6cd69776ff31f7d4cb439e2723eefc.webm?t=1774551746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/ae6cd69776ff31f7d4cb439e2723eefc.mp4?t=1774551746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/de033b08a3bacb627ec4a982b09e1d16.avif?t=1774551746\" width=723 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core splitter is made by a  solo indie developer including music, art, assets, programming and story. The game takes  inspiration from Factorio and Satisfactory which are some of my favorite all time games. While also putting a different spin on some mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Splitter Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy